<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7336"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 14, 2005 - 11:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Very interesting Joel, also considering this post from BTK &#40;If it is from the real BTK&#41;: <BR> <BR>BTK <BR> Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 10:47 pm:      <BR> <BR>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------ <BR> to solve this mystery one n ee ds to educate thy self <!--/Text--></td></tr>
